&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and attention to detail are critical, as is time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech savvy: you will be actively utilizing internal information systems, Google Suites, Slack, Zoom and other applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible: you may be required to work weekends, holidays, and hours outside of Entrupy’s public online hours of 10:00 AM to 7:00 PM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
