&lt;p&gt;You’ll work cross-functionally with Authentication, Training, Engineering, and Product teams, acting as both a subject matter expert and a strategic partner. This role requires high-level thinking, strong judgment, and the ability to lead projects from concept through execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to: Knowledge Team Lead&lt;br&gt;Location: Remote -Philippines, India, Hong Kong, Japan, Dubai (United Arab Emirates)&lt;/p&gt;
