&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert in luxury handbag and leather goods authentication, supporting high-impact authentication and training initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make meaningful contributions to the development, evolution, and quality control of Entrupy’s knowledge systems, ensuring they are accurate, scalable, and aligned with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse authentication trends, error patterns, and product data to identify gaps, risks, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive medium- to large-scale projects related to new brand and product support, knowledge structure, tooling, or content strategy, including defining scope, timelines, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create advanced documentation, product intelligence frameworks, and reference materials that support expert-level decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering and Product teams to inform how knowledge is structured, tagged, and surfaced within Entrupy’s platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and refinement of training programs, helping raise the overall expertise of the global authentication team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of market trends, brand updates, and emerging counterfeit techniques, translating insights into actionable knowledge assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide guidance to more junior Knowledge Analysts, supporting team growth and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in authentication, knowledge management, luxury goods research, fashion merchandising, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise in authenticating luxury and contemporary handbags and leather goods, with strong brand-level knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to think analytically about data, patterns, and systems, not just individual cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading projects or initiatives independently, with a track record of follow-through and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written communication skills, with the ability to synthesise complex information into clear, usable resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail paired with strong judgment and investigative instincts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with large visual datasets, structured documentation, and analytical tools (spreadsheets, tagging systems, internal platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and confidence working cross-functionally in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep interest in fashion, luxury, craftsmanship, and the role of authentication in protecting consumers and brands.&lt;/li&gt;
