&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Scale the Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, lead, and evolve a high-performing, globally distributed ML team across India and Europe. Define team structure, hire and develop senior talent, establish clear ownership, and create a culture of accountability, rigor, and high-quality execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the ML and computer vision roadmap, aligning technical direction with business priorities and customer impact. Translate company goals into a clear, executable plan with measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure consistent delivery of production-grade ML systems from research to deployment — with a focus on scalability, reliability, and speed. Balance long-term innovation with near-term impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance Core Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide the development of computer vision models for authentication and fingerprinting, ensuring models are accurate, robust, and practical for real-world use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Systems &amp;amp; Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee ML infrastructure, training and inference pipelines, and deployment systems. Drive optimization for performance, including edge deployment, latency, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Global Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with product, engineering, and operations teams to define priorities and deliver outcomes. Drive alignment and effective execution across India and Europe teams, ensuring clarity, consistency, and strong communication across geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish best practices, define success metrics, and drive continuous improvement across models, systems, and team processes. Use data and production feedback to inform decisions and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 12+ years in machine learning/computer vision, with a strong track record of building and leading high-performing teams and delivering production systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to build, scale, and lead globally distributed teams. You know how to develop senior talent, create clarity in ambiguous environments, and drive accountability without micromanaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to translate business goals into clear ML strategy and execution plans. You balance long-term vision with near-term delivery and make thoughtful trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in machine learning and computer vision, with the ability to guide architectural decisions, evaluate approaches, and challenge teams where needed without needing to be in the weeds day-to-day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring a high degree of ownership and can drive complex, cross-functional initiatives from concept through production. You know how to scale systems, processes, and teams effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working across geographies (India and Europe), aligning teams, and building strong cross-functional partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to clearly articulate complex ideas to both technical and non-technical stakeholders, including executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Pragmatic, curious, and impact-driven. You care about solving real problems, not just building elegant models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
