&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-competitive, pay equity-focused compensation structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health benefits and insurance coverage&lt;/li&gt;
